<p>Karte hai maatam haram abbas ka<br />
ho gaya marna sitam abbas ka</p>

<p>Ran se ye shabbir ko aayi sada<br />
jald qabar leejiye shaahe huda<br />
aap ke qadmo'n pa ho qaadim fida<br />
ho gaye abbas ke shaane juda</p>

<p>Ghamzada zainab se ye sheh ne kaha<br />
chord sidhaare hame bhaiya kaha'n<br />
mashq chidi khoo'n me alam bhar gaya<br />
ab na alamdar na lashkar raha</p>

<p>Gham me baraadar ke hai tooti kamar<br />
chal base akber nahi aata nazar<br />
kaampte haatho pa hai laashe pisar<br />
gham se phata jaata hai sheh ka jigar</p>

<p>Sibte nabi tum pa ho laakho salaam<br />
ho gaye ummat pa fida tashnakaam<br />
arz ye mazhar ki hai tumse imaam<br />
rouza dikha deejiye shaahe anaam<br />
</p>